 "body": {
  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "Which note recorded the handover of feature-flags to Boreal, and on what date?\n[2025-09-29] handover/2025-09-29-feature-flags: Feature-flags has a new home: team Boreal. Cinder kept it until today. [2026-02-24] handover/2026-02-24-feature-flags: Quick one: the flags service belongs to the Cinder team starting today. Thanks to the Boreal team for running it until now. [2025-09-08] standup/boreal/2025-09-08-2: New dependency for billing-api: feature-flags. Billing-api will gate the new invoice flow behind feature-flags; the reasoning is that the rollout needs a per-tenant kill switch. Boreal noticed that the notifier's request volume halved after the client rollout and pinged the owners.",
  "dimensions": 1536
